  "description": {
   "en": "Collection of Mihara Mitsukazu's one-shots (2005):\n\n- Ch. 1 - Slice of Black Chocolate (2001) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/wz4adqj?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"Generally… a story about really cute guy trying to hook up with this really egotistic girl… although it's not really like that.\"\n\n- Ch. 2 - The Vampire \u0026 I (2001) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/9023ktd?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"A dark european ambient and the story of a vampire … just before dinner time.\"\n\n- Ch. 3 - Children Can't Choose Their Parents (2000) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/eua0juz?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"A haunting story about a man and his chicken. You will never look at an egg the same way again after reading this story!\"\n\n- Ch. 4 - Cut the Angel with a Scythe (2002) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/7xes9iy?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"Angela is suffering from a terrible illness that keeps her confined… One day a magician comes to her window to visit… Will his magic change her fate?\"\n\n- Ch. 5 - The End in Common Ruin (2002) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/jmm0fja?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"A story about two twins…\"\n\n- Ch. 6 - Deserted Place (2002) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/al2hlpo?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"The story follows the journey of a mysterious boy who brings peace to deserted places and things…\"\n\n- Ch. 7 - Alice in Underground (2003) - [MU](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/9kq7bop?utm_source=mangadex)\n\u003e \"This short oneshot tells the adventures of Alice, but with a slightly darker tone.\""
  },
